<title>USA: ShopKo says margins in line with plan.</title>
<headline>ShopKo says margins in line with plan.</headline>
<dateline>GREEN BAY, Wis. 1997-04-10</dateline>
<text>
<p>ShopKo Stores Inc, reporting a 3.5 percent rise in same-store sales for the five weeks ended April 5, said despite the early Easter, sales and margins were in line with management plans.</p>
<p>The company did not elaborate.</p>
<p>It said total sales rose 18.5 percent in the period to $217.1 million from $183.2 million.</p>
<p>ShopKo was off 1/8 at 17-7/8.</p>
<p>		((Reuters Chicago Newsdesk (312) 408-8787))</p>
